      "changeReason": "V1.20: the V1.18 battery backpack frame refitted to the switch in hand, a Swann 39 (SPST 15 A 125 VAC, solder lugs). Its 11.5 mm body (Shawn 2026-10-17) did not pass the V1.18 10.6 mm hole (REV-31-1387 cutout). The floor hole is now the Swann cutout 12.3 x 27.5 mm (Swann catalogue 27.4 x 12.3 mm for the same family), the rocker pocket 14.4 mm wide for the 13.8 mm flange, and the battery pocket starts 0.3 mm behind the measured body, so the box is 27.45 mm deep (V1.18 26.75). Single watertight body, 713 mm2 rim contact; print gate passed 2026-10-17. Evidence: back-plate/battery-backpack-20261015/build/build.json, bp_checks.json, README.md.",
